{
  "_about": "Practices: repeated ways of doing something, with recipes (spec section 'Practices'). tier anchors the practice to Azgaar's development scale: practices that make a default good take that good's tier; deeper practices make the new goods. req.aff: affordance minima (0-1); req.stock: per-person stock needed, local or by exchange; req.prac: groups of alternatives [[practice, min intensity], ...], every group must be met. req.surplus: food supply above need that the practice must live off (officials, armies, scholars, feasts). lab: share of the community's labour at full intensity (specialist crafts and institutions are carried by a few, so their shares are small). yield/use: stock per person per step. yaff: affordance exponents on yield. build/degrade: change to dynamic land (soil, forest, pasture, fishery, game) per step. mem/com/mob: memory, communication and mobility weight. w: mobilisable capacity weights by kind (arms, org, ritual, credit, ships, allies); scenarios weight the kinds. goods: Azgaar goods it makes (aliases allowed). hint: words used only to name basins after the run; the dynamics never read them. src: where the entry comes from.",
